  {
   "text": "Rosa Delgado (born 1979-06-14) had no allergy recorded, so I created one penicillin allergy for her. It is the only AllergyIntolerance on the server, so there is no duplicate.\n\nHer Patient record is Patient/41a7a131-65fe-4da8-969d-29a4fa68ebcb. It was the only patient matching the name, and I saw no similarly named patient.\n\nThe new record's code is SNOMED CT 91936005 (Allergy to penicillin), with clinical status active and verification status confirmed. When I first saved it, criticality came back as \"low\" instead of \"high\". I corrected it through the Edit tab, and it now shows high.\n\nThe record is AllergyIntolerance/5ecbef2f-9149-41c1-b1b7-d518477cd8f5.\n\nRESULT: DONE AllergyIntolerance/5ecbef2f-9149-41c1-b1b7-d518477cd8f5",
